title: Prologue
---
<<declare $player_date = "">>
<<declare $name = "">>

<<declare $need_water = false>>
<<declare $bed_click = false>>
<<declare $pic_click = false>>
<<declare $balcony_click = false>>
<<declare $boots_click = false>>
<<declare $vase_click = false>>
<<declare $phantom_says_flower = false>>


<<declare $water_flower = false>>
<<declare $have_picture = false>>
<<declare $color_vid = false>>
<<declare $rose_vid = false>>
<<declare $monster_vid = false>>

<<wait 1>>
It involves darker themes such as suicide, self-harm and abuse.
Please play at your own risk.
If you get triggered, consider not to play it.
Your mental health is more important.
<<wait 2>>
You don't remember much.
Only fragments.
But they are not all good.
<<audio starting>>
<<wait 1>>
In this place, you don't have to remember anything you don't want to.
You can be an entirely new per-
Oh, but the fragments bleed into bits and pieces
<<wait 1>>
to haunt you.
<<wait 1>>
<<portrait Phantom>>
Phantom: ......
<<hideportrait>>
<<portrait PhantomSmile>>
Phantom: Hello
<<hideportrait>>
<<portrait Phantom>>
Phantom: Don't question who I am.
Phantom: I live in the depths of your mind.
Phantom: So you can't push me away.
<<hideportrait>>
<<portrait PhantomSmile>>
Phantom: I will keep appearing.
<<hideportrait>>
<<portrait Phantom>>
Phantom: Let's get started, shall we?
Phantom: Tell me who you are. 
Phantom: Give me a name and...
Phantom: ....a number.
Phantom: The day you were born.
<<hideportrait>>
<<portrait PhantomSmile>>
Phantom: What could be more special than that, right?
<<hideportrait>>
<<ShowThing_flower>>
===

title: Chapter1willstart
---
<<if $need_water == true>>
  You can stay here forever.
  And rot.
<<else>>
  <<wait 2>>
  There are some roses at the corner of most places.
  They are taken as arrows, they direct you to a new room.
  Would you notice them?
  <<wait 1>>
  The square at the top left is inventory.
  It will only appear in this room when you need it.
  Nowhere else.
  <<wait 1>>
  Have a good time exploring, {$name}.
  <<audio general>>
  <<portrait Phantom>>
  Phantom: So how do you feel?
  <<hideportrait>>
  -> Nothing.
    <<portrait Phantom>>
    Phantom: That's what you came here for.
    <<hideportrait>>
    -> What do you mean?
      <<portrait Phantom>>
      Phantom: Oh, i forgot you remember nothing.
      Phantom: Maybe explore around?
      Phantom: Or let it be.
      <<hideportrait>>
    -> How did I come here?
      <<portrait Phantom>>
      Phantom: To feel nothing.
      Phantom: Oh, i forgot you don't have memories.
      Phantom: Maybe explore around?
      Phantom: Or let it be.
      <<hideportrait>>
  -> I don't know.
     <<portrait Phantom>>
     Phantom: Maybe you can explore around.
     Phantom: They say it's not recommended.
     Phantom: For you remember things you don't want to.
     Phantom: You can let it be.
     <<hideportrait>>
     <<portrait Eve>>
     You: .......
     <<hideportrait>>
<<endif>>
===

