title: monster1_talk
---
<<if $monster_vid == true>>
  <<portrait Monster2>>
  Monster: Don't disturb me.
  <<hideportrait>>
  <<portrait Eve>>
  You: I haven't said anything.
  <<hideportrait>>
  <<portrait AngryMonster2>>
  Monster: ......
  <<hideportrait>>
<<else>>
  <<portrait Monster2>>
  Monster: What?
  <<hideportrait>>
  <<portrait Eve>>
  You: Can you give me some water?
  <<hideportrait>>
  ......
  Maybe they haven't heard.
  <<portrait Eve>>
  You: Can you give-
  <<hideportrait>>
  <<audiostop kitchensound>>
  <<audio screaming>>
  <<portrait AngryMonster2>>
  Monster: AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
  <<hideportrait>>
  <<audiostop screaming>>
  <<wait 2>>
  <<portrait Phantom>>
  Phantom: Not surprised, are you?
  <<audio dollhouse>>
  <<hideportrait>>
  <<portrait Eve>>
  You: .......
  <<hideportrait>>
  <<bwOff>>
  In a distant, forgotten memory, you were asking something.
  You thought they didn't hear you.
  You asked again.
  <<wait 1>>
  What happened then?
  <<wait 1>>
  <<hideobj You>>
  <<play monster_vid2>>
  <<ShowThing_monster2>>
  <<turnBW>>
  <<wait 2>>
  Maybe. they didn't hear you.
  <<set $monster_vid = true>>
<<endif>>
