title: monster3_talk
---
<<portrait Monster3>>
Monster: Are you new?
Monster: Why did you choose to come here?
<<hideportrait>>
<<portrait Eve>>
You: I....didn't.
<<hideportrait>>
<<portrait Monster3>>
Monster: Oh no, everyone chooses this place.
<<hideportrait>>
-> What's so good about this place?
   <<portrait Monster3>>
   Monster: It slowly makes you like them.
   Monster: Feeling nothing anymore.
   <<hideportrait>>
   -> What's so bad about feeling?
     <<portrait Monster3>>
     Monster: Don't you know?
     Monster: You can't be the only one.
     Monster: It needs another soul to understand you.
     <<hideportrait>>
    -> Them?
      <<portrait Monster3>>
      Monster: ......
      Monster: The ones in the kitchen.
      Monster: They don't like me.
      <<hideportrait>>
      -> Why?
        <<portrait Monster3>>
        Monster: I am not trying harder.
        Monster: To turn like them.
        Monster: I still feel too much.
        Monster: I feel lonely.
        <<hideportrait>>
      -> You must be unloveable.
        <<portrait Monster3>>
        Monster: .....
        Monster: I had a heart shape on both sides of my head.
        Monster: They said it did not belong here.
        Monster: So they severed one of the hearts.
        Monster: The other is still holding onto the shape.
        Monster: But fragile.
        Monster: Will you be the one to severe it too?
        <<hideportrait>>
      -> Bye
       <<portrait Monster3>>
       Monster: I'm so lonely.
       <<hideportrait>>
    -> Bye
       <<portrait Monster3>>
       Monster: I'm so lonely.
       <<hideportrait>>
-> Why do they choose it?
   <<portrait Monster3>>
   Monster: To escape quickly.
   Monster: You don't have to look back.
   Monster: Stay here and feel nothing.
   Monster: I am failing at it.
   <<hideportrait>>
   -> It's okay.
     <<portrait Monster3>>
     Monster: Really?
     <<hideportrait>>
     <<portrait Eve>>
     You: Yes.
     <<hideportrait>>
     <<portrait Monster3>>
     Monster: Thank you.
     <<hideportrait>>
   -> Try harder.
     <<portrait Monster3>>
     Monster: .......
     Monster: You can be friends with them.
     <<hideportrait>>
     <<portrait Eve>>
     You: Who?
     <<hideportrait>>
     <<portrait Monster3>>
     Monster: The ones in the kitchen. You might like them.
     Monster: More than me.
     <<hideportrait>> 
-> Bye
  <<portrait Monster3>>
  Monster: I'm so lonely.
  <<hideportrait>>
===


