  Phantom: {$player_date} might be a day you died but you were born too.
  Phantom: That's how you are here with me.
  Phantom: Thank you for visiting this place, {$name}.
  Phantom: Farewell.
  Phantom: May we meet again.
  <<hideportrait>>
  <<wait 2>>
  <<quit>>
<<else>>
  <<audio starting>>
  <<ShowThing_bed>>
<<endif>>
